Z||000008||batboy||12-17-2000||11:09 AM||||Good eye, Ogre! I didn't notice that they were different until you pointed it out.<P>In some repects, the OEM luggage rack is kind of cool, but I sure don't want to keep it on my Batmobile when I finally get around to repainting it.<P>Good deck lids are easy to find and fairly cheap. Fortunately, I have another silver Fiero with a clean deck lid, so I'm just going to swap them. I've changed my mind a half dozen times about body mods, but I keep coming back to the IMSA style rocker panel ground effects and wrap around rear spoiler. Sweet!||||reg||1
