Z||000010||theogre||12-17-2000||02:38 PM||||Well..... I kind of like the psudo wing look of the OE rack. Also, I actually use mine from time to time. <P>When I bought my lawn mower I put its box up there. <P>I put a transmission on it once but I tied it to the deck lid itself. I didn't want to take chances of a wierd shape like that moving. I put a chunk of plywood under it to pretect the lid.<P>Those are probly the largest things I've put on it. I throw 80# bags of water softener salt on there about 2-3 times a year. much easier to lift them off the lid than out of the seat or trunk.||||reg||1
